      "rationale": "The paper supports reuse through a CSRM-derived CubeSat template/reference model, existing diagram templates and component library, and a repeatable process for tailoring the model with mission-specific requirements and payload details. The PSAT1U baseline itself is reusable because mission and payload modules are deliberately left undefined within a design envelope, and interfaces/components are central to the model. Do not code 'specific-mission model with reusable method only' because the model itself is claimed as a reusable template. Do not code 'low-dynamics / non-detailed-behavior model' because the paper does not directly frame limited behavior/dynamics modeling as the reuse mechanism.",
